/target
tasks/

# Agent and editor tooling that happens to live in the checkout. None of it is
# part of the build, and `.superpowers/sdd/` holds per-task briefs, reports and
# review diffs that belong to a session rather than to the project.
.claude/
.superpowers/
.serena/

# `socket.rs`'s unit tests need a socket path short enough to fit `sun_path`, so
# they scratch in the workspace root rather than under TMPDIR. The guard removes
# them; a panicking test does not.
.mr-*/

# macOS and Python droppings. The spike directories are run in place.
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# `insta` writes these beside the accepted snapshot on any snapshot failure, and deletes
# neither on a later pass — three mutation runs each left five untracked files behind. They are
# review artefacts for `cargo insta review`, never commits.
*.snap.new
*.pending-snap
